/**
 * Intrinsic dimensions and responsive variants for every plate.
 *
 * MAINTAINED BY HAND against the sizes produccion/edicion.py prints as it cuts
 * them. This used to say "generated by produccion/edicion.py", which no script
 * in the repository performs — `grep -n "medidas\|MEDIDAS" produccion/*.py`
 * returns nothing. A claim that a file is generated is a claim nobody needs to
 * check it, which is the opposite of true here.
 *
 * Section 91. Without width/height the browser cannot reserve space and the
 * document reflowed as plates decoded; without srcset a 390px phone pulled a
 * 1680px plate whole. Typing either by hand would let them drift from the
 * assets the pipeline cuts, so both are read off the files.
 */
